{"zh":"我们与一艘在[cutholoid_under_radar.solar_system.GetName]的科研船[this.GetName]失去了联系。\n\n最后的通讯表明他们当时正在调查一颗附近的小行星，[cutholoid_under_radar.GetName]。\n\n建议靠近这个恒星系的话一定要小心点。","en":"We have lost communication with our science ship [this.GetName] in [cutholoid_under_radar.solar_system.GetName].\n\nTheir last transmission indicated they were beginning a survey on a nearby asteroid, [cutholoid_under_radar.GetName].\n\nCaution is advised when re-entering this system."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/be54c031eade3b90b35b.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[],"source":{"file":"common/event_chains/00_event_chains_grand_archive.txt","line":1},"names":{"cutholoid_under_radar.solar_system.GetName":{"zh":"这个星系","en":"this system"}}},{"id":"special_projects:HIDDEN_CUTHOLOID_ATTACK_PROJECT","kind":"project","title":{"zh":"摧毁小行星","en":"Destroy the Asteroid"},"texts":[{"zh":"[cutholoid_under_radar.GetName]小行星不可貌相。我们需要派遣一支小有规模的军队前去，在[this.GetName]科研船永远离开我们之前将其救出。","en":"The asteroid [cutholoid_under_radar.GetName] is not what it seems to be. We should approach with a sizable military force and attempt to recover our science ship [this.GetName] before it is gone for good."}],"sections":[{"zh":"轨道上有$COUNT$/$REQUIRED$支战斗力至少为600的舰队。","en":"Has $COUNT$/$REQUIRED$ fleet(s) with at least 600 fleet power in orbit."}],"image":"art/be54c031eade3b90b35b.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"grand_archive.3020","kind":"project","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"project","source":"common/special_projects/04_projects_grand_archive.txt:68","hooks":["on_fail"],"story":"event-grand-archive-3010"},{"target":"grand_archive.3018","kind":"condition","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"condition","group":"c39964","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"exists","arg":"event_target:cutholoid_under_radar","scope":"","value":false}]],[[{"type":"other","key":"can_go_mia","arg":"yes","scope":"","value":true}]]],"through":["grand_archive.3017"],"source":"common/special_projects/04_projects_grand_archive.txt:93","hooks":["immediate"],"story":"event-grand-archive-3010"}],"source":{"file":"common/special_projects/04_projects_grand_archive.txt","line":26}},{"id":"grand_archive.3020","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"失去科研船","en":"Science Ship Lost"},"texts":[{"zh":"[from.GetName]的应急通讯戛然而止。我们只能相信[from.GetName]科研船已经永远离我们而去了。","en":"The emergency transmissions from [from.GetName] have ceased. We can only assume the science ship [from.GetName] has been lost for good."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/9dcdce7bbb89abf1fd0d.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"UNFORTUNATE","label":{"zh":"真不幸。","en":"Unfortunate."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/grand_archive_events.txt","line":3522}},{"id":"grand_archive.3018","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"兽口脱险","en":"From the Belly of the Beast"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们在[current_system.GetName]失踪的科研船回来了！\n\n[leader.GetName]发回的报道称，他们被一个藏在小行星中的太空实体整个吞下，最后在船体就要承受不住的时候意外地被吐了出来。似乎有什么别的东西把这个生物吓了一跳让我们侥幸逃脱。\n\n在有更多的认知之前，探索这片小行星带可要多加小心了。","en":"Our Science Ship lost in [current_system.GetName] has returned!\n\nReports have come in from [leader.GetName] that they had been swallowed whole by a spaceborne entity hiding inside of an asteroid, and were at the limits of hull integrity before being unexpectedly ejected to safety. It appears something else has surprised the creature before we could intervene.\n\nWe should be cautious in our approach of certain asteroid belts until we can learn more."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/26d119352b46f7328d80.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"grand_archive.3018.a","label":{"zh":"真幸运。","en":"How fortunate."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/grand_archive_events.txt","line":3488},"names":{"current_system.GetName":{"zh":"这个星系","en":"this system"},"leader.GetName":{"zh":"这位领袖","en":"the leader"}}},{"id":"special_projects:HIDDEN_CUTHOLOID_CAPTURE_PROJECT","kind":"project","title":{"zh":"捕获小行星","en":"Capture the Asteroid"},"texts":[{"zh":"[cutholoid_under_radar.GetName]小行星不可貌相。我们有了合适的科技，可以将其整个捕获并在[this.GetName]永远离开我们之前将其轻易地救出。","en":"The asteroid [cutholoid_under_radar.GetName] is not what it seems to be. With the right technology, we could capture it entirely and easily recover our science ship [this.GetName] before it is gone for good."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/be54c031eade3b90b35b.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"grand_archive.3016","kind":"project","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"project","through":["grand_archive.3015"],"source":"common/special_projects/04_projects_grand_archive.txt:137","hooks":["on_success","immediate"],"sets":["captured_hiding_cutholoid","has_ever_captured_a_cutholoid","leader_digested_by_cutholoid","revealed_hiding_cutholoid"],"story":"event-grand-archive-3014"}],"source":{"file":"common/special_projects/04_projects_grand_archive.txt","line":100}},{"id":"grand_archive.3011","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"科研船失踪","en":"Science Ship Missing"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们的一艘科研船在[cutholoid_under_radar.solar_system.GetName]调查一颗奇怪的小行星时失去了联系。\n\n在他们最后失踪的地点探测到了微弱的应急信号，我如果要找回这艘失踪的舰船就需要进一步调查。","en":"Contact has been lost with our Science Ship while investigating a strange asteroid in [cutholoid_under_radar.solar_system.GetName].\n\nWe are detecting weak emergency signals from their last known location, and should investigate further if we intend to recover the missing vessel."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/9dcdce7bbb89abf1fd0d.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"grand_archive.3011.a","label":{"zh":"太糟了。","en":"This is bad."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/grand_archive_events.txt","line":3272},"names":{"cutholoid_under_radar.solar_system.GetName":{"zh":"这个星系","en":"this system"}}},{"id":"grand_archive.3012","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"发现小行星实体","en":"Asteroidal Entity Discovered"},"texts":[{"zh":"在[from.solar_system.GetName]进行例行探索的过程中发现了另一个奇怪的小行星状生物。\n\n我们应该避免让科研船接近这个星系，直到我们对这个危险的物体有更多的了解为止。","en":"Another of the strange asteroidal creatures have been discovered in [from.solar_system.GetName] during routine exploration.\n\nWe should avoid this system with our Science Ships until we know more about these dangerous objects."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/e46ed16d9ecad64b7572.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"grand_archive.3012.a","label":{"zh":"继续调查。","en":"Continue investigations."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/grand_archive_events.txt","line":3288},"sets":["met_another_cutholoid"],"names":{"from.solar_system.GetName":{"zh":"这个星系","en":"this system"}}}]}